WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.834
-Welcome back, everybody!

00:00:01.834 --> 00:00:03.569
I am hanging out
with Tom Hiddleston!

00:00:03.569 --> 00:00:06.172
[ Cheers and applause ]
Oh, there you go!

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:09.943
It is time right now
for "The Mimic Challenge."

00:00:09.943 --> 00:00:11.010
Here we go.

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:13.112
-♪ Mimic challenge ♪

00:00:13.112 --> 00:00:16.949
♪ Mimic, mimic challenge, yeah ♪

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:18.518
-Now here's how it works.

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:21.820
We're gonna take turns at making
noises with different objects,

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:24.890
and the other person has
to immediately match that sound

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:27.027
as precisely as they can.

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:29.062
-It's insane and foolish,
and I love it.

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:30.396
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:33.299
-Since you're my guest,
you'll make the first noise,

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:35.602
and I will mimic.
-Okay.

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:38.738
Make this sound.

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:40.506
[ Bell ringing ]

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:42.575
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:44.510
-Didl-idl-idl-idl-idl-idl-idl-
idl-idl-idl-idl-idl-idl-idl!

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:47.513
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:00:47.513 --> 00:00:48.915
[ Ding! ]
-See what I'm saying?

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:50.983
-Yes!
Yes.

00:00:50.983 --> 00:00:52.685
Amazing.

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:54.820
-Now it is your turn to mimic.

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.758
Tom, make this sound.

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:05.164
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.164 --> 00:01:06.299
[ Noodles cracking ]

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:08.668
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:12.204
-Okay.

00:01:12.204 --> 00:01:13.573
[ Imitating cracking ]

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:15.341
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:16.809
[ Cheers and applause ]
[ Ding! ]

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:19.478
♪♪

00:01:19.478 --> 00:01:22.348
-That's actually really good.
All right.

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:25.017
All right, it's my turn.
Tom, you're up.

00:01:25.017 --> 00:01:29.088
-Oh, sh-- uh, Jimmy...
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.088 --> 00:01:33.459
...make this sound.

00:01:33.459 --> 00:01:37.597
[ Paper crinkling ]

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:39.165
-[ Whooshing ]

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:41.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:42.302
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:43.536
[ Ding! ]

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:45.771
-That was great.
That was great.

00:01:45.771 --> 00:01:47.339
-I'm not good
at all of these sounds.

00:01:47.339 --> 00:01:51.911
Yeah, all right.
But, Tom, I'm pretty good...

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:53.879
at this sound.

00:01:53.879 --> 00:01:55.448
See if you can make this sound.

00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:57.183
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:58.952
Do I have to do this on camera,
or how does this work?

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:01.120
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:02.788
All right.

00:02:02.788 --> 00:02:04.958
Well, that way
is probably better?

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.826
All right, ready?
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:08.628
Is that way better,
or, no, is that worse?

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:11.730
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:14.466
I don't know what way is --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:14.466 --> 00:02:15.901
All right.

00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:18.705
That way.
-Regular!

00:02:18.705 --> 00:02:21.207
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:22.775
-"Regular."
All right, let me start.

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:24.911
All right.

00:02:24.911 --> 00:02:29.382
[ Rapid rattling ]

00:02:29.382 --> 00:02:31.717
-Okay, okay.

00:02:31.717 --> 00:02:34.754
[ Muffled grunting ]
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.754 --> 00:02:36.489
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:37.624 line:0%
♪♪

00:02:37.624 --> 00:02:39.558
[ Ding! ]

00:02:39.558 --> 00:02:44.763
Amazing.

00:02:44.763 --> 00:02:49.068
-Well, there -- there --
there's the meme of the summer.

00:02:49.068 --> 00:02:52.871
There you go.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.871 --> 00:02:54.273
All right, Tom.

00:02:54.273 --> 00:02:58.177
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.177 --> 00:03:00.913
Make this sound.

00:03:00.913 --> 00:03:05.751
[ Honking ]
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.751 --> 00:03:07.987
I didn't know this is supposed
to make that sound, Tom.

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:10.223
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.223 --> 00:03:13.126
Ready?

00:03:13.126 --> 00:03:14.127
[ Honking ]

00:03:14.127 --> 00:03:16.395
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.395 --> 00:03:18.731
-[ Heaving ]
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:20.099
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:20.099 --> 00:03:22.001 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:22.001 --> 00:03:30.843
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:03:30.843 --> 00:03:35.114
[ Both laugh ]

00:03:35.114 --> 00:03:39.552
-Jimmy, make this sound.
-Mm-hmm.

00:03:39.552 --> 00:03:42.455
[ Duck call sounds ]

00:03:42.455 --> 00:03:44.089
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.089 --> 00:03:46.259
[ Duck call sounds ]

00:03:46.259 --> 00:03:48.060
[ Laughter ]

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:49.228
[ Duck call sounds ]

00:03:49.228 --> 00:03:50.529
[ Laughter ]

00:03:50.529 --> 00:03:53.932
-Pwwwpppt!
Pwwwpppt!

00:03:53.932 --> 00:03:55.067
[ Cheers and applause ]
[ Ding! ]

00:03:55.067 --> 00:03:59.505
Pwwwpppt!
Pwwwpppt!

00:03:59.505 --> 00:04:00.706
-Pretty good.

00:04:00.706 --> 00:04:03.509
-All right, Tom,
let's do one more.

00:04:03.509 --> 00:04:08.114
Tom, can you make this sound?

00:04:08.114 --> 00:04:09.181
[ High-pitched air horn blares ]

00:04:09.181 --> 00:04:12.451
[ Audience groans ]

00:04:12.451 --> 00:04:13.552
-[ Squealing ]

00:04:13.552 --> 00:04:14.787
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:04:14.787 --> 00:04:16.489
[ High-pitched air horn blares ]

00:04:16.489 --> 00:04:19.191
[ Both squealing ]

00:04:19.191 --> 00:04:22.194
-[ Squealing ]
-[ Squealing ]

00:04:22.194 --> 00:04:24.130
-My thanks
to Tom Hiddleston right there!

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:26.098
Talented man!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:26.098 --> 00:04:28.568
"Loki" is available on Disney+!

